# Nothing rendered, recorded or compiled belongs in a public course repository.
#
# THE TWO CATEGORIES THAT MUST NEVER LAND HERE, and why this file leads with
# them: course METADATA lives in the private catalogue, and course MEDIA lives
# on the NAS. On 2026-08-27 transcripts, an outline, course metadata and a
# design prompt were committed to a public specialization repo. The three-home
# split exists because of that incident, and these patterns are the mechanical
# half of it.

# Course media and its staging root (a symlink to the NAS on a build host).
coursera-assets
coursera-assets/
rendered/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.srt
*.srt.lock

# Course metadata -- belongs in the private catalogue, never here.
*.course.yaml
*-narration-script.md
*.script.md
*.quorum.json
*.manifest.yaml
*.edl.json

# Rust build output
target/
**/target/
*.rlib
*.rmeta
*.pdb

# Compiled objects and executables
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
